  <diagram name="Copy of Use Case Diagram" id="d_GBLkasPli1EHvj7xg1">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2110" dy="598" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="MgjXFrB0o8tqnVMefJgv-0" />
        <mxCell id="MgjXFrB0o8tqnVMefJgv-1" parent="MgjXFrB0o8tqnVMefJgv-0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle ShreeAnna Smart Millet Platform - Use Case Diagram\n\nleft to right direction\n\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam packageStyle rectangle\nskinparam actorStyle stickman\n\nskinparam rectangle {\n    BorderColor #166534\n    BackgroundColor #F8FAFC\n}\n\nskinparam usecase {\n    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF\n    BorderColor #166534\n}\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; ACTORS\n&#39; =========================\n\nactor Farmer\nactor \&quot;FPO Coordinator /\\nProcurement Officer\&quot; as FPO\nactor \&quot;Quality Inspector\&quot; as Inspector\nactor \&quot;Logistics Officer\&quot; as Logistics\nactor \&quot;Warehouse Officer\&quot; as Warehouse\nactor \&quot;Processor / SHG\&quot; as Processor\nactor Consumer\nactor \&quot;Finance Officer\&quot; as Finance\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; SYSTEM\n&#39; =========================\n\nrectangle \&quot;ShreeAnna Smart Millet Platform\&quot; {\n\n    &#39; Farmer\n    usecase \&quot;Manage Farmer Account\&quot; as UC1\n    usecase \&quot;Submit Millet Lot\&quot; as UC2\n    usecase \&quot;View Lot Status\&quot; as UC3\n\n    &#39; Quality\n    usecase \&quot;Request Quality Inspection\&quot; as UC4\n    usecase \&quot;Inspect Millet Lot\&quot; as UC5\n    usecase \&quot;Issue Quality Certificate\&quot; as UC6\n\n    &#39; Farmer Procurement\n    usecase \&quot;Negotiate Farmer Purchase\&quot; as UC7\n    usecase \&quot;Create Farmer Agreement\&quot; as UC8\n\n    &#39; Warehouse / Inbound\n    usecase \&quot;Receive Millet\&quot; as UC9\n    usecase \&quot;Verify Quantity &amp; Quality\&quot; as UC10\n    usecase \&quot;Manage Warehouse Inventory\&quot; as UC11\n\n    &#39; Processor Purchase\n    usecase \&quot;Browse Available Millet Lots\&quot; as UC12\n    usecase \&quot;Submit Purchase Request\&quot; as UC13\n    usecase \&quot;Propose Processor Agreement\&quot; as UC14\n    usecase \&quot;Accept / Reject Agreement\&quot; as UC15\n    usecase \&quot;Make Purchase Payment\&quot; as UC16\n\n    &#39; Logistics\n    usecase \&quot;Schedule Shipment\&quot; as UC17\n    usecase \&quot;Assign Vehicle &amp; Driver\&quot; as UC18\n    usecase \&quot;Confirm Pickup / Dispatch\&quot; as UC19\n    usecase \&quot;Track Shipment\&quot; as UC20\n    usecase \&quot;Confirm Delivery\&quot; as UC21\n\n    &#39; Marketplace\n    usecase \&quot;Create Product Listing\&quot; as UC22\n    usecase \&quot;Manage Product Listing\&quot; as UC23\n    usecase \&quot;Browse Products\&quot; as UC24\n    usecase \&quot;Place Consumer Order\&quot; as UC25\n    usecase \&quot;Track Consumer Order\&quot; as UC26\n\n    &#39; Finance\n    usecase \&quot;Process Farmer Payment\&quot; as UC27\n    usecase \&quot;Process Processor Payment\&quot; as UC28\n    usecase \&quot;Process Consumer Payment\&quot; as UC29\n}\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; FARMER\n&#39; =========================\n\nFarmer --&gt; UC1\nFarmer --&gt; UC2\nFarmer --&gt; UC3\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; FPO\n&#39; =========================\n\nFPO --&gt; UC2\nFPO --&gt; UC3\nFPO --&gt; UC4\nFPO --&gt; UC7\nFPO --&gt; UC8\nFPO --&gt; UC14\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; QUALITY INSPECTOR\n&#39; =========================\n\nInspector --&gt; UC5\nInspector --&gt; UC6\n\nUC4 ..&gt; UC5 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC5 ..&gt; UC6 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; FARMER PROCUREMENT\n&#39; =========================\n\nUC7 ..&gt; UC8 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC8 ..&gt; UC27 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\nFinance --&gt; UC27\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; WAREHOUSE\n&#39; =========================\n\nWarehouse --&gt; UC9\nWarehouse --&gt; UC10\nWarehouse --&gt; UC11\n\nUC9 ..&gt; UC10 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC10 ..&gt; UC11 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; PROCESSOR / SHG\n&#39; =========================\n\nProcessor --&gt; UC12\nProcessor --&gt; UC13\nProcessor --&gt; UC15\nProcessor --&gt; UC16\nProcessor --&gt; UC22\nProcessor --&gt; UC23\n\nUC12 ..&gt; UC13 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC13 ..&gt; UC14 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC15 ..&gt; UC16 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\nFinance --&gt; UC28\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; LOGISTICS\n&#39; =========================\n\nLogistics --&gt; UC17\nLogistics --&gt; UC18\nLogistics --&gt; UC19\nLogistics --&gt; UC20\nLogistics --&gt; UC21\n\nUC17 ..&gt; UC18 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC18 ..&gt; UC19 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC19 ..&gt; UC20 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC20 ..&gt; UC21 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; OUTBOUND / DELIVERY\n&#39; =========================\n\nProcessor --&gt; UC21\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; MARKETPLACE / CONSUMER\n&#39; =========================\n\nConsumer --&gt; UC24\nConsumer --&gt; UC25\nConsumer --&gt; UC26\n\nUC25 ..&gt; UC24 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC25 ..&gt; UC29 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\nFinance --&gt; UC29\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="U7OqEQl6o1Pbs3sb5b5c-0">
